{"id":72805,"date":"2026-11-05T18:38:46","date_gmt":"2026-11-05T18:38:46","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=72805"},"modified":"2026-11-05T19:43:10","modified_gmt":"2026-11-05T18:43:10","slug":"legua-de-arruda-dos-pisoes","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/legua-de-arruda-dos-pisoes\/","title":{"rendered":"L\u00e9gua de Arruda dos Pis\u00f5es 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">L\u00e9gua de Arruda dos Pis\u00f5es 2026<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>L\u00e9gua de Arruda dos Pis\u00f5es 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no dia <strong>22 de novembro de 2026<\/strong> (domingo), com in\u00edcio das provas \u00e0s <strong>10:00<\/strong> na <strong>Rua das Faias, n\u00ba 14, em Arruda dos Pis\u00f5es<\/strong>, no concelho de <strong>Rio Maior<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Santar\u00e9m<\/strong>. Integrada no <em>Torneio de Atletismo das Freguesias de Rio Maior \u00abJorge Miguel\u00bb (Edi\u00e7\u00e3o 2026\/2027)<\/em> e organizada em parceria pela <strong>Junta de Freguesia de Arruda dos Pis\u00f5es<\/strong>, coletividades locais e <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Rio Maior<\/strong>, a competi\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 aberta a atletas federados e n\u00e3o federados com inscri\u00e7\u00f5es 100% gratuitas.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A manh\u00e3 desportiva arranca com os escal\u00f5es de forma\u00e7\u00e3o \u2014 <strong>Benjamins A (520 m \u00e0s 10:00)<\/strong>, <strong>Benjamins B (770 m \u00e0s 10:10)<\/strong>, <strong>Infantis (1 km \u00e0s 10:20)<\/strong> e <strong>Iniciados\/Juvenis (2 km \u00e0s 10:30)<\/strong> \u2014, culminando \u00e0s <strong>10:50<\/strong> com a partida da prova principal de <strong>5,2 km (L\u00e9gua)<\/strong> destinada aos escal\u00f5es de Juniores, Seniores e Veteranos I a IV (masculinos e femininos). O evento atribui pr\u00e9mios aos 5 primeiros de cada escal\u00e3o e \u00e0s 5 melhores equipas, encerrando \u00e0s 13:00 com almo\u00e7o conv\u00edvio.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; let